{
  "chapter": "steam",
  "quests": [
    {
      "key": "gg.steam.intro",
      "title": "Steam-Age Arms",
      "tier": "Steam",
      "desc": [
        "Before electricity, there is bronze. The Steam chapter builds everything with a crafting table, a hammer and a file: a single-shot Hand Cannon, stone ammunition, and three sets of light armor. No machine is required, although one steam-powered Ammo Press makes bullets for you.",
        "The gate material here is bronze (wrought iron for the Miner set). Hold eight bronze plates to open the chapter; the Hand Cannon eats a plate, and the Steam armor takes fourteen.",
        "The plan is simple. Build the cannon and some bullets, test them on zombies, then dress for the job: Heavy Cloth is the base of every armor set, and bronze plates armor the parts that matter. When you have all of that and a few steel plates, the LV chapter is next.",
        "[note]This chapter pays the first loot bags and Pam's snacks. Eat up, then go shoot something.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
