    {
      "key": "gg.steam.stone_bullets",
      "title": "Stone Bullets",
      "tier": "Steam",
      "desc": [
        "The Hand Cannon eats one Stone Bullet per shot, so you will want a lot of them. At a crafting table, three cobblestone, a gunpowder and a bronze nugget make sixteen bullets. Hold thirty-two to finish the quest.",
        "Gunpowder drops from creepers, and GregTech can mix it too. Bronze nuggets are made from bronze ingots. If you would rather not hand-craft, the next quest builds a steam machine that does it for you.",
        "[note]Stone Bullets are Steam-tier ammo. Rounds for the LV guns are made in the Ammo Press from brass foil, lead or steel rounds, and gunpowder.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
