      "title": "Heavy Cloth",
      "tier": "Steam",
      "desc": [
        "Heavy Cloth is the lining of almost every armor set in GregGuns, from the Steam age to the late game. Four wool blocks of any color around a piece of leather make three of it at a crafting table.",
        "You need plenty: the Steam armor alone takes eight pieces on top of its bronze plates. Hold nine to finish this quest, which is three crafts of wool and leather.",
        "[note]Any wool color works, and any mix of colors.[/note]"
