    {
      "key": "gg.steam.miner_armor",
      "title": "T1 Miner Armor",
      "tier": "Steam",
      "desc": [
        "The Miner set trades some of the Scout's lightness for wrought iron plates and a helmet with a yellow band. The Miner's Jacket is the quest item: Heavy Cloth framed by wrought iron plates, crafted by hand. Wrought iron comes from the Better Than Iron quests, and its plates are hammered flat from ingots.",
        "All four pieces are crafted at a table; NEI shows each pattern. The helmet wants yellow dye, and the boots use wrought iron nuggets.",
        "[note]Wrought iron is the alternative gate for the Steam tier. If you have bronze but no wrought iron yet, build the Scout set first.[/note]"
      ],
