    {
      "key": "gg.ev.steam_armor",
      "title": "Steam Armor",
      "tier": "Steam",
      "desc": [
        "The Steam set is the best protection you can build without a single circuit: bronze plates over Heavy Cloth, fourteen plates in all for the full set. The chestplate is the quest item (five plates and three cloth), and it is more than armor: it is a small steam engine.",
        "Carry coal or charcoal in your inventory and the chestplate burns it to power the set. Powered, the full set makes you faster, a little tougher and a better jumper. Without fuel it is still armor.",
        "[note]One piece of coal or charcoal refuels a quarter of a full charge. The chestplate only burns one when it has room for all of it, so nothing is wasted.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
